## Phase 1 Analysis: Robin Fuentes — Improving Edge Podcast on Agentic AI

---

### 0. Speaker Identification

**Host/Moderator:** Unnamed (based on internal references — "our organization," mentioning Jake Stevenson as "one of my co-workers" — this appears to be an Improving employee hosting the show). The host contributes genuine observations beyond filler: cites David Allen's "psychic weight" concept, references a weekend report on shadow AI statistics, introduces the delegation framing and "smart trust" terminology. These are substantive contributions, not just prompts.

**Guest/SME:** **Robin Fuentes** — President, Improving Houston Enterprise (also called South Texas internally). Robin is the primary practitioner voice. All war stories, operational examples, and counter-intuitive positions originate with him unless otherwise noted.

**Attribution rule applied throughout:** Where the host contributed a substantive point, it is attributed to the host. Where Robin built on a host prompt, the insight is credited to Robin. Jake Stevenson is a named third party (Robin's co-worker) who originated the communication-coaching prompt concept — credited to him, not Robin.

